A	organizer|Festival organizer Pim	bandleader|Bandleader Suli
C	festival_plan	0	greet	Pim lists what the square needs
N	greet						The festival is in three days and the square is bare. I need lanterns, bunting and a band, in whatever order you can manage.
O	pies					Anything else?
O	go					I will get started.
N	pies		l	greet			Fish pies, if you can. Nobody dances hungry. That is a bonus, not a condition.
N	go						Suli is by the fountain if you want to start with the band.
C	band_hire	1	greet	Suli agrees to play
N	greet						Pim sent you? We will play, if the square has somewhere to stand and the pay is honest.
O	play					What do you play?
O	booked					Consider it booked.
N	play		l	greet			Whatever keeps feet moving. Reels, mostly.
N	booked						Then we start tuning. Save us a pie.
C	festival_open	0	look	Pim opens the festival
N	look			open			Lanterns up, bunting hung, and I can hear Suli tuning from here.
N	open						That is a festival. Ring the bell, we are open.
